{
 "id": "3f096a0d-4727-4f75-bec8-278e0390c0fa",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Let's go to my brother's house"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "오빠 집으로 가자"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yoo Ji-an, the owner of Café Florence, has someone in her life who acts more like an older brother than her actual brother.\nHe’s Choi Jae-geon, the heir to Hwaseong Construction, who always seems frustratingly (or intriguingly) obsessed with her.\nOne day, after an unexpected incident leaves Ji-an with nowhere to go... Jae-geon is the first to reach out.\n\"Let’s go to my place.\"\nAnd so, their cohabitation begins.\nTheir relationship, once filled with endless bickering and heated arguments—where every meeting turned into a clash—starts shifting strangely, charged with an unexplainable tension.\n\"Come to my room.\"\nA simple phrase from Jae-geon sends Ji-an’s heart racing..."
  },
